DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The ggssccssiioo driver provides support for the National Semiconductor Geode
     SC1100 System-on-Chip Super I/O module.  The Super I/O (SIO) module in‐
     corporates one serial port, an infrared communication port, two AC‐
     CESS.bus interface (ACB) ports, system wakeup control (SWC), and a real-
     time clock (RTC).  Only the ACCESS.bus interface is currently supported.

     ACB is a two-wire synchronous serial interface compatible with the
     Philips' I2C bus, and can be accessed through the iic(4) framework.  The
     ggssccssiioo driver programs the ACB port to work with a standard I2C frequency
     100kHz.

